    "name": "Bingo Pets - Save the Pets",
    "steam_appid": 2464470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/ac172b58575942c433c645821245c54b.poster.avif?t=1697721049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/ac172b58575942c433c645821245c54b.webm?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/ac172b58575942c433c645821245c54b.mp4?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Step into an enchanting realm where your love for bingo meets the joy of rescuing adorable pets. If the thrill of scoring 'Bingo!' sends a wave of excitement through you, and if your heart melts at the sight of cute animals, here's a game that impeccably marries your passions. Discover a whole new spin on the classic game of bingo as you delve into an immersive narrative rich with charming characters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/a7f3c5cb52c4b5843756c3008c1f6b6f.poster.avif?t=1697721049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/a7f3c5cb52c4b5843756c3008c1f6b6f.webm?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/a7f3c5cb52c4b5843756c3008c1f6b6f.mp4?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In this unique gameplay experience, you're not merely playing rounds of bingo but embarking on a noble quest. The objective is to collect coins while you match your numbers. These aren't just ordinary coins; they hold the key to the freedom of your lovable pet companions. From bunnies and squirrels to sugar gliders and owls, each pet awaits your rescue. Fear not, as your trusted canine companion, aptly named BINGO, is right by your side to help you in your missions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/b96e0dbd64be43c71b115862b090280b.poster.avif?t=1697721049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/b96e0dbd64be43c71b115862b090280b.webm?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/b96e0dbd64be43c71b115862b090280b.mp4?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your pets are active contributors to the game. Their purpose goes beyond looking cute. Send them on missions to collect food for your furry squad, adding another dimension to the gameplay.<br><br>Personalize your gaming experience with options to choose between 2-card or 4-card bingo. Adjust the call speed according to your comfort, and pick a Male or Female voiceover for the number calls. For a more relaxed experience, opt for the auto-daub feature and never worry about missing a bingo call. This game is much more than just a standard bingo app\u2014it's an adventure where each match is a step closer to rescuing your cherished pets and experiencing the joy of a perfect bingo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/6d8be4842c5b00b3572cd47b5400cb9f.poster.avif?t=1697721049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/6d8be4842c5b00b3572cd47b5400cb9f.webm?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/6d8be4842c5b00b3572cd47b5400cb9f.mp4?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/ac172b58575942c433c645821245c54b.poster.avif?t=1697721049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/ac172b58575942c433c645821245c54b.webm?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/ac172b58575942c433c645821245c54b.mp4?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Step into an enchanting realm where your love for bingo meets the joy of rescuing adorable pets. If the thrill of scoring 'Bingo!' sends a wave of excitement through you, and if your heart melts at the sight of cute animals, here's a game that impeccably marries your passions. Discover a whole new spin on the classic game of bingo as you delve into an immersive narrative rich with charming characters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/a7f3c5cb52c4b5843756c3008c1f6b6f.poster.avif?t=1697721049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/a7f3c5cb52c4b5843756c3008c1f6b6f.webm?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/a7f3c5cb52c4b5843756c3008c1f6b6f.mp4?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In this unique gameplay experience, you're not merely playing rounds of bingo but embarking on a noble quest. The objective is to collect coins while you match your numbers. These aren't just ordinary coins; they hold the key to the freedom of your lovable pet companions. From bunnies and squirrels to sugar gliders and owls, each pet awaits your rescue. Fear not, as your trusted canine companion, aptly named BINGO, is right by your side to help you in your missions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/b96e0dbd64be43c71b115862b090280b.poster.avif?t=1697721049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/b96e0dbd64be43c71b115862b090280b.webm?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/b96e0dbd64be43c71b115862b090280b.mp4?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your pets are active contributors to the game. Their purpose goes beyond looking cute. Send them on missions to collect food for your furry squad, adding another dimension to the gameplay.<br><br>Personalize your gaming experience with options to choose between 2-card or 4-card bingo. Adjust the call speed according to your comfort, and pick a Male or Female voiceover for the number calls. For a more relaxed experience, opt for the auto-daub feature and never worry about missing a bingo call. This game is much more than just a standard bingo app\u2014it's an adventure where each match is a step closer to rescuing your cherished pets and experiencing the joy of a perfect bingo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/6d8be4842c5b00b3572cd47b5400cb9f.poster.avif?t=1697721049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/6d8be4842c5b00b3572cd47b5400cb9f.webm?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464470/extras/6d8be4842c5b00b3572cd47b5400cb9f.mp4?t=1697721049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid